==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For zombie enemies, use anti-zombie units, for an example you can try [[Shigong Cat]], [[Ectoweight Cat]], [[Weedwacker Cat]], [[Mimic Cat]] and [[Corrupted Psychocat]] (if you have zombie target talent for him).

For Dark enemies, you can use anti-Dark units. [[Bombercat]] to freeze them, and use [[Pizza Cat]] to deal a lot of damage for example.

Because of the fact that Bun Bun Black is also a floating enemy, you can use [[Fishman Cat]] to deal another massive damage to him, you can also try other anti-floating units of you have them.

